---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Felipe Rezende — Engineering Manager @ Nubank">
  <header class="t-fade">
    <h1 class="t-h1"><span class="text-terminal-green">❯</span> whoami</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose-term t-fade">
    <p class="text-hi">felipe rezende · engineering manager @ nubank · são paulo, br</p>
    <p>this is my technical lab notebook. i build experiments in systems programming, mobile, and web — mostly for learning, sometimes for utility.</p>

    <h2>contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>github: <a href="https://github.com/feliperezende" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/feliperezende</a></li>
      <li>linkedin: <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/felipe-rezende-em" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in/felipe-rezende-em</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>speaking / writing</h2>
    <p>the experiments on this site are personal — i build them to learn, not to present them. what i'm actually up for discussing publicly is <span class="text-hi">engineering management</span> and <span class="text-hi">AI</span>: how teams are organised, how they adopt AI tooling in practice, and what breaks along the way.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>topics: engineering management, AI in engineering orgs</li>
      <li>formats: internal talks, panels, conversations — no conference circuit</li>
      <li>published writing: <a href="https://feliperezende.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">feliperezende.github.io</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>this site</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">astro</a> + <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tailwind</a></li>
      <li>hosted on <a href="https://pages.github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github pages</a></li>
      <li>source: <a href="https://github.com/feliperezende/labs.resenha.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/feliperezende/labs.resenha.org</a></li>
      <li>analytics: none — no cookies, no tracking, no third-party requests</li>
      <li>fonts: jetbrains mono</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>license</h2>
    <p>content: cc by-nc-sa 4.0 · code: mit · unless otherwise noted.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>